{
  "about": "The requests and replies both protocol clients are tested on (docs/clients.md): each case an operation, its input and what it gives. \"error\": true is a refusal, whatever its message; a case without \"expect\" is held only to both clients giving the same (tests/clients_agree.py).",
  "cases": [
    {"op": "encode", "in": ["add", ["lv2:urn:example:gain", 3]], "expect": "add lv2:urn:example:gain 3"},
    {"op": "encode", "in": ["remove", [3]], "expect": "remove 3"},
